Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.39,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur2\fad(250,250)}思い出の宝庫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.39,0:01:29.26,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur2\fad(250,250)}古いものは棚の奥に
